"╭ Prompt for an AI assistant (same as atfq ask) ───────────────────────────────╮"
"│I have a question about my Linux machine.                                     │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│## My question                                                                │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│Help me understand "Memory" on my machine.                                    │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│## My system                                                                  │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│- Distribution: Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie)                                  │"
"│- Kernel: 6.12.48-amd64                                                       │"
"│- Architecture: x86_64                                                        │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│## Background (from the atfq hub "Memory")                                    │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│How much RAM you have, who is using it, and why "used" doesn't mean what you  │"
"│think.                                                                        │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│Useful commands:                                                              │"
"│                                                                              │"
"│- `free -h`: RAM and swap, in human units                                     │"
"│- `vmstat 1`: memory and swap activity every second (Ctrl-C stops)            │"
"╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯"
" PROMPT  esc close  ↑↓ scroll  q quit                                M mouse:on "
